guamp: answer MTLGPUFamilyApple2 to SpringBoard too (AdrenoMetal 2ff4be9, NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm)

The board withholds every Apple family (NativeMetalWithhold "apple-families", GuampAdrenoProbe.cpp); Apple2 is answered only to
NMB_APPLE2_CLIENTS (default "Preferences,iconservicesagent"). MPSDevice::GetMPSDevice asks supportsFamily: from Apple9 down to
Apple2 and returns nil when none is supported; Siri's orb prewarm in SpringBoard then creates an MPSKernel and Metal aborts it
("[%@ initWithDevice:] Failed to get MPSDevice.", MPSKernel.mm:95), three times a boot (fin9..fin9g, 30/10). With Apple2, MPS
takes its generic device type (no "Apple A8X GPU" name match) and loads its kernels from the AIR default.metallib files of
MetalPerformanceShaders.framework. The render server (backboardd) keeps every Apple family withheld. Applied by the GPU workflow
after 0001.

diff --git a/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm b/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
index 1ca89f9..a094204 100644
--- a/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
+++ b/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm
@@ -2512,7 +2512,12 @@ static uint64_t askAnswer(SEL cmd,NSUInteger arg) {
  static const SEL family=sel_registerName("supportsFamily:");
  static const bool withholdApple1=[]{const char *w=getenv("NMB_WITHHOLD");return w && strstr(w,"apple1-family");}();
  static const bool withholdApple=[]{const char *w=getenv("NMB_WITHHOLD");return w && strstr(w,"apple-families");}();
- static const bool apple2Client=[]{const char *list=getenv("NMB_APPLE2_CLIENTS");if(!list)list="Preferences,iconservicesagent";
+ // SpringBoard too (guamp 30/10): with every Apple family withheld, MPSDevice::GetMPSDevice (MPSCore 0x1dff42f28 in iPadOS 17.7.11)
+ // finds no family from Apple9 down to Apple2 and returns nil, and Siri's orb prewarm (-[SiriPresentationViewController
+ // prewarmOrbViewShaders] -> SUICOrbView -> MPSKernel initWithDevice:) aborts SpringBoard in MTLReportFailure "Failed to get
+ // MPSDevice." three times a boot. Apple2 alone gives MPS its generic device (no Apple GPU name matched), whose kernels come from
+ // the AIR default.metallib files of MetalPerformanceShaders.framework, compiled like any other library.
+ static const bool apple2Client=[]{const char *list=getenv("NMB_APPLE2_CLIENTS");if(!list)list="Preferences,iconservicesagent,SpringBoard";
   const char *name=getprogname();if(!name)return false;const size_t len=strlen(name);
   for(const char *at=list;*at;) {const char *end=strchr(at,',');const size_t part=end?(size_t)(end-at):strlen(at);
    if(part==len && !strncmp(at,name,len))return true;if(!end)break;at=end+1;}
